    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Emperor’s Chosen",
    "summary": "In the Emperor's Chosen detachment, Rendax is the Favoured Ka'tah, so the Rendax ka'tah ability of Martial Ka'tah also gives this extra effect to the unit using it: you may pick one enemy MONSTER or VEHICLE unit engaged with that unit, then roll a single D6. A roll of 1-2 inflicts 1 mortal wound on it, 3-5 inflicts D3 mortal wounds, and 6 inflicts 3 mortal wounds.",
